The Logical Redstone Archive catalogue in this folder (entries.jsonl) was made by
maybeachromium (GitHub: SolsticeSpectrum) and is shared under the WTFPL, version 2.
Source: https://github.com/horizon-rust/horizon/issues/10103 (lra-catalog-2026-11-05.zip).

This licence covers the catalogue only. The archive's schematics, by the
Logical Redstone Archive's contributors, have no licence: they are not in this
repository, and tools/test_redstone_catalog_parity.py downloads them at run time.

